metrics on $\mathcal{E}$ given by \emph{Theorem 36}; the limit $H=\lim\limits_{t\rightarrow\infty}H_t$ exists and is a smooth Hermitian Yang-Mills metric on  $\mathcal{E}$, exponentially asymptotic  in all derivatives [cf. \emph{Notation 34}] to $H_0$ along the tubular end of $W$: 
